@ProductionApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### List products (anonymous, paged)
GET {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Search products
GET {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=desk
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/health

### Get a development token (development environment only)
# @name devToken
POST {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com"
}

### Create a product (requires the token above)
POST {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Ergonomic Chair",
  "description": "Adjustable lumbar support.",
  "price": 349.00,
  "stockQuantity": 12
}

### Validation failure example (price must be greater than zero)
POST {{ProductionApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "stockQuantity": -1
}
